      voice: 'gemini:Kore | sharp, friendly co-host: asks what a smart listener would, pushes back with real objections, sometimes explains; dry wit, never exaggerated; brisk lively pace, never slow #ctx:15veoa7'
    '|b||The long course: it keeps cheaper rivals out of the board members'' own market, whatever it does for hygiene.':
